<title>AUSTRIA: Austrian Jan inflation 1.9 pct y/y, 0.1 pct m/m.</title>
<headline>Austrian Jan inflation 1.9 pct y/y, 0.1 pct m/m.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Central Statistics Office</p>
<p>reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> AUSTRIAN INFLATION	  JANUARY     DECEMBER    JAN 1996</p>
<p> Monthly CPI index rise	0.1	    0.0	  0.5</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr inflation	    1.9	    2.3	  1.7</p>
<p> Index (base 1986)	   131.4	  131.3	129.0</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom, +43-1 531 12 254</p>
</text>
